# Build artefacts -- install.sh recreates the venv, and it is full of
# absolute paths that would be wrong on anyone else's machine.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Over GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit (302 MB). Regenerate with:
#   .venv/bin/python i3d/vr_testpattern.py
i3d/testpat/vr4k_h264.mp4

# NOT redistributed. These are VITURE's, recovered from the SpaceWalker
# Android app, and their Terms of Service grant no right to republish them
# (s3.1/3.2 forbid decompiling and redistributing their content). The
# analysis in i3d/DESIGN.md and the Python port are ours; these are not.
# See i3d/README.md for how to obtain them yourself.
i3d/shaders/
i3d/model/

# Kept local, not published. Notes on the vendor's own application, taken
# while working out how to drive the glasses on Linux.
RE-FINDINGS.md

# Local state
imu-probe.json
/tmp/
*.log
